{"seq":3,"slug":"healthy-materials-indoor-environment","title":"健康材料与室内环境质量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/sustainable-net-zero-architecture/materials-circularity/healthy-materials-indoor-environment","wordCount":2289,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"健康材料与室内环境质量\">健康材料与室内环境质量</h1><p>把一块刨花板锯开，闻到的那股刺鼻气味，往往是脲醛树脂胶在常温下持续水解释放的游离甲醛。它不会因为建筑通过了节能验收就消失——恰恰相反，零碳建筑为了把热损失压到极限，气密性做得越来越好（被动房要求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>50</mn></msub><mo>≤</mo><mn>0.6</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mtext>h</mtext><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{50} \\le 0.6\\ \\text{h}^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.786em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">50</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">h</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其原理与 MVHR 机械新风见 <a href=\"../energy-and-systems/high-performance-envelope\">高性能围护结构与超低能耗</a>），换气次数下降，任何从材料里渗出的污染物都更容易在室内累积。于是出现一个本章必须直面的张力：低碳与健康并非天然同盟，省下的运行碳如果以牺牲呼吸的空气为代价，就不是真正的可持续。这一篇讲的，就是如何在选材环节同时守住「碳」与「人」两条底线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从-低排放-到-全成分透明\">核心概念：从「低排放」到「全成分透明」</h2><p>健康材料的判定逻辑在过去十年发生了一次范式迁移。早期只问「这块材料往空气里放多少 VOC」（排放视角），现在的领先标准追问「这块材料里到底有什么成分、它的全生命周期对人和环境意味着什么」（成分透明视角）。两者叠加，才构成今天「健康 + 低碳」材料的完整画像。</p>\n<p>下图是一块装修材料从进场到被验收为「健康且低碳」需要穿过的几道闸门：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[候选材料] --&gt; B{成分披露&lt;br/&gt;HPD / Declare 标签?}&#10;  B --&gt;|无披露| X[不可用:成分黑箱]&#10;  B --&gt;|有披露| C{含红色清单&lt;br/&gt;Red List 物质?}&#10;  C --&gt;|含禁用物| X&#10;  C --&gt;|清洁| D{VOC 排放检测&lt;br/&gt;CDPH Standard Method}&#10;  D --&gt;|TVOC &gt; 限值| X&#10;  D --&gt;|达标| E{隐含碳&lt;br/&gt;EPD 声明?}&#10;  E --&gt;|无 EPD| F[可用但碳不可核]&#10;  E --&gt;|有 EPD 且低碳| G[健康且低碳:可纳入清单]\">flowchart TD\n  A[候选材料] --&gt; B{成分披露&lt;br/&gt;HPD / Declare 标签?}\n  B --&gt;|无披露| X[不可用:成分黑箱]\n  B --&gt;|有披露| C{含红色清单&lt;br/&gt;Red List 物质?}\n  C --&gt;|含禁用物| X\n  C --&gt;|清洁| D{VOC 排放检测&lt;br/&gt;CDPH Standard Method}\n  D --&gt;|TVOC &gt; 限值| X\n  D --&gt;|达标| E{隐含碳&lt;br/&gt;EPD 声明?}\n  E --&gt;|无 EPD| F[可用但碳不可核]\n  E --&gt;|有 EPD 且低碳| G[健康且低碳:可纳入清单]</pre><p>把主流标准对「材料」这一维度的侧重点放在一起对比，能看清各自的盲区：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>标准体系</th>\n<th>材料维度关注点</th>\n<th>健康侧强度</th>\n<th>碳侧强度</th>\n<th>透明度抓手</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>中国绿建《标准》（GB/T 50378）</td>\n<td>节材与材料资源利用 + 室内环境质量</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>检测报告</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GB 50325-2020</td>\n<td>室内空气污染物浓度限值</td>\n<td>高（强制）</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>竣工检测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LEED v4.1</td>\n<td>Low-Emitting Materials + Building Product Disclosure</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>中（EPD 加分）</td>\n<td>EPD / HPD</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WELL v2</td>\n<td>X 类「材料」概念，覆盖空气/水/光/材料十维</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>成分披露</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Living Building Challenge 4.0</td>\n<td>Red List 禁用 + 隐含碳 + 负责任采购</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>Declare 标签</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>来源：<a href=\"https://www.igreen.org/index.php?m=content&amp;c=index&amp;a=show&amp;catid=15&amp;id=12885\">LEED v4.1 Indoor Environmental Quality / 友绿智库绿色建筑标准对比</a>、<a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/57366945\">WELL 十维健康建筑</a>、<a href=\"https://living-future.org/red-list/\">Living Future Red List</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"室内空气污染物-强制限值才是底线\">室内空气污染物：强制限值才是底线</h2><p>在中国，谈健康材料绕不开 GB 50325-2020《民用建筑工程室内环境污染控制标准》。它不是评优用的加分项，而是竣工验收的强制门槛——不达标的工程不允许交付使用。它把管控对象从早年的甲醛、苯、氨、氡、TVOC 五项，扩展到七项，新增了甲苯与二甲苯（来源：<a href=\"http://www.jianbiaoku.com/webarbs/book/105/4311890.shtml\">GB 50325-2020 标准说明</a>）。</p>\n<p>关键限值按建筑类别分级。Ⅰ类民用建筑（住宅、幼儿园、医院病房、学校教室、老年人设施等对人体最敏感的空间）要求最严：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>污染物</th>\n<th>Ⅰ类限值</th>\n<th>Ⅱ类限值</th>\n<th>检测条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>甲醛 (HCHO)</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>0.07</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mtext>mg/m</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le 0.07\\ \\text{mg/m}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.204em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.07</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mg/m</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.954em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>0.08</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mtext>mg/m</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le 0.08\\ \\text{mg/m}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.204em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.08</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mg/m</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.954em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>封闭 1 小时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>苯</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>0.06</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mtext>mg/m</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le 0.06\\ \\text{mg/m}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.204em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.06</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mg/m</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.954em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>0.09</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mtext>mg/m</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le 0.09\\ \\text{mg/m}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.204em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.09</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mg/m</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.954em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>封闭 1 小时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TVOC</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>0.45</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mtext>mg/m</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le 0.45\\ \\text{mg/m}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.204em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.45</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mg/m</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.954em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>0.50</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mtext>mg/m</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le 0.50\\ \\text{mg/m}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.204em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.50</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mg/m</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.954em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>封闭 1 小时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>来源：<a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/475249679\">GB 50325-2020 甲醛/苯/TVOC 限量</a>。注意 2020 版相比 2010 版把甲醛检测从「关闭 1 小时」的口径明确化，并整体收严了 Ⅰ类限值——这意味着用同一批材料、按老经验配比，在新标准下完全可能不通过。</p>\n<p>一个实用的工程估算：室内某污染物的稳态浓度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 近似正比于材料单位面积释放率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 与暴露面积 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 之积，反比于通风量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>，即</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>out</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><mi>Q</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C \\approx C_{\\text{out}} + \\frac{E \\cdot A}{Q}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">out</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2408em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>零碳建筑刻意压低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>（用热回收新风替代大风量稀释）来保住能耗，这就把降污的责任几乎全部推给了「降低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span>」——也就是源头选用低释放材料，而非靠通风兜底（建模方法参见 <a href=\"https://www.sciengine.com/doi/pdf/7D95098D53B7468BA0A1094F73DB42BF\">材料污染释放率与浓度响应估算</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"排放检测-cdph-方法与-tvoc-分级\">排放检测：CDPH 方法与 TVOC 分级</h2><p>国际项目（以及国内做 LEED/WELL 认证的项目）普遍以加州公共卫生部 CDPH Standard Method（v1.2）作为低排放材料的测试基准。它把材料放进环境舱模拟实际使用浓度，第 14 天测量挥发物，按 TVOC 划三档：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mtext>mg/m</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le 0.5\\ \\text{mg/m}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.204em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mg/m</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.954em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>5</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mtext>mg/m</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5\\text{–}5\\ \\text{mg/m}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.204em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mg/m</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.954em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>5</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mtext>mg/m</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge 5\\ \\text{mg/m}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.204em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mg/m</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.954em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（来源：<a href=\"https://www.eurofins.com/consumer-product-testing/services/certifications-international-approvals/voc/sustainable-buildings/\">Eurofins Sustainable Buildings VOC</a>）。</p>\n<p>这里要厘清一个常被混淆的概念——「VOC 含量」与「VOC 排放」是两回事：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>VOC 含量</strong>（content）：每升涂料里有多少克 VOC，是配方属性。所谓「零 VOC」涂料指无人为添加 VOC 且固体分中 VOC <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>5</mn><mtext> g/L</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le 5\\ \\text{g/L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">g/L</span></span></span></span></span></span>（来源：<a href=\"https://continuingeducation.bnpmedia.com/courses/behr/greener-building-materials/\">BNP Media Greener Building Materials</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>VOC 排放</strong>（emission）：材料在使用环境中实际释放到空气里的速率，由 CDPH 环境舱法测得。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>低含量不必然低排放——某些「低 VOC」涂料为压低标称含量改用半挥发性增塑剂，环境舱里的长期释放反而更糟。健康材料清单应同时索取含量声明与排放检测报告，二者缺一不可。</p>\n<p>天然材料在这一维度有结构性优势：木材、纤维素、夯土等不仅本身释放低，研究还发现它们对 VOC 有更高的吸附能力，能充当室内空气的「缓冲海绵」（来源：<a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC7796468/\">Natural Building Materials and Indoor Emissions, NCBI</a>）。这正是「低碳」与「健康」少有的双赢点——同一块 CLT 既封存了生物碳，又是低排放的吸附体。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成分透明-red-list-hpd-与-declare-标签\">成分透明：Red List、HPD 与 Declare 标签</h2><p>排放达标只回答了「放出来的安全吗」，没回答「材料本身藏着什么」。Living Building Challenge 用 Red List（红色清单）给出最激进的答案：清单上的物质——邻苯二甲酸酯、卤代阻燃剂、PVC、甲醛、全氟化合物等——在符合条件的项目中一律禁用。这份清单逐年收紧：2026 年，受美国 TSCA 监管的有机磷阻燃剂（OPFR）以及华盛顿州聚氨酯泡沫中的同类物质将正式进入红色清单（来源：<a href=\"https://living-future.org/red-list/\">Living Future Red List</a>、<a href=\"https://living-future.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Fact-Sheet-The-Living-Building-Challenge-LBC-Red-List-2024-Update_-A-Guide-for-Manufacturers-1.pdf\">LBC Red List 2024 Update Fact Sheet</a>）。</p>\n<p>值得注意的是 2026 年 4 月 3 日 Living Future 引入的新例外：当某红色清单化学品是规范与消防安全所必需、且尚无更安全替代品时（典型如部分大体积木材产品的防火处理），允许有条件使用——这承认了「绝对禁用」与「现实可建」之间需要工程妥协（来源：<a href=\"https://trimtab.living-future.org/healthy-materials/expanding-the-pathway-for-mass-timber-in-living-building-projects/\">Trim Tab: Mass Timber in Living Building projects</a>）。</p>\n<p>落到采购环节，三类披露文件构成可核验的证据链：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>HPD（Health Product Declaration）</strong>：成分级健康披露，逐一列出材料含有的物质及其危害特性。</li>\n<li><strong>Declare 标签</strong>：被称作材料界的「营养成分表」，一张标签同时声明成分披露阈值、VOC 含量与排放、隐含碳、负责任采购，并标注与 LBC、LEED、WELL 的对齐情况（来源：<a href=\"https://living-future.org/declare/basics/\">Declare basics, Living Future</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>EPD（Environmental Product Declaration）</strong>：环境产品声明，给出隐含碳等全生命周期环境数据，是连接「健康」与「低碳」的关键文件（EPD 在碳核算中的可信度阶梯见 <a href=\"../fundamentals-carbon/whole-life-and-embodied-carbon\">全生命周期碳与隐含碳核算</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>把 HPD/Declare（管健康）与 EPD（管碳）并排索取，就能让材料同时对「人」和「碳」负责，而不是顾此失彼。</p>\n<h2 id=\"在中国落地-双认证与可执行清单\">在中国落地：双认证与可执行清单</h2><p>理论标准要变成竣工的房子，需要本土化的执行路径。一个已建成的参照是应用材料公司位于上海的中国总部大楼，它同时拿下 LEED 绿色建筑与 WELL 健康建筑金级双认证——证明在中国市场把「低碳」（LEED 侧重能源与材料）与「健康」（WELL 侧重空气、材料、心理福祉）合并交付是可行的（四套认证体系的评分逻辑与双认证协同详见 <a href=\"../certification-policy-practice/green-building-rating-systems\">绿色建筑认证体系</a>）（来源：<a href=\"https://www.prnasia.com/story/519455-1.shtml\">应用材料上海总部 LEED+WELL 双认证</a>）。</p>\n<p>对一个具体项目，可操作的健康低碳选材流程如下：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[确定使用空间类别&lt;br/&gt;Ⅰ类按最严标准] --&gt; B[设定材料准入清单&lt;br/&gt;禁用 Red List 物质]&#10;  B --&gt; C[向供应商索取三件套&lt;br/&gt;排放报告 + HPD/Declare + EPD]&#10;  C --&gt; D[源头降释放&lt;br/&gt;而非靠新风稀释]&#10;  D --&gt; E[竣工封闭检测&lt;br/&gt;对照 GB 50325 限值]&#10;  E --&gt;|不达标| F[追溯单一来源材料&lt;br/&gt;替换重测]&#10;  E --&gt;|达标| G[移交运营&lt;br/&gt;持续监测室内空气]\">graph TD\n  A[确定使用空间类别&lt;br/&gt;Ⅰ类按最严标准] --&gt; B[设定材料准入清单&lt;br/&gt;禁用 Red List 物质]\n  B --&gt; C[向供应商索取三件套&lt;br/&gt;排放报告 + HPD/Declare + EPD]\n  C --&gt; D[源头降释放&lt;br/&gt;而非靠新风稀释]\n  D --&gt; E[竣工封闭检测&lt;br/&gt;对照 GB 50325 限值]\n  E --&gt;|不达标| F[追溯单一来源材料&lt;br/&gt;替换重测]\n  E --&gt;|达标| G[移交运营&lt;br/&gt;持续监测室内空气]</pre><p>这个流程的核心理念，是把验收从「事后检测」前移为「事前选材」：在零碳建筑的高气密前提下，等到竣工封闭检测才发现甲醛超标，整改成本极高（往往要拆换已安装的板材柜体）。把成分透明与排放门槛写进采购合同，比在交付前抱着仪器祈祷靠谱得多。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>零碳建筑的高气密性放大了任何材料污染——低碳与健康必须同时设计，不能用通风兜底。</li>\n<li>判定范式已从「低排放」迁移到「低排放 + 全成分透明」：既看放出来什么，也看本身含什么。</li>\n<li>GB 50325-2020 是中国强制底线：Ⅰ类甲醛 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>0.07</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mtext>mg/m</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le 0.07\\ \\text{mg/m}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.204em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.07</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mg/m</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.954em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、TVOC <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>0.45</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mtext>mg/m</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le 0.45\\ \\text{mg/m}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.204em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.45</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mg/m</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.954em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，封闭 1 小时检测，七项污染物管控。</li>\n<li>VOC 含量 ≠ VOC 排放；用 CDPH 环境舱法看实际释放，二者都要索证。</li>\n<li>Red List 逐年收紧（2026 年新增 OPFR 阻燃剂），HPD/Declare 管健康、EPD 管碳，并排索取构成证据链。</li>\n<li>天然材料（木、纤维素、夯土）是健康与低碳的双赢点，兼具低释放与 VOC 吸附能力。</li>\n<li>落地关键是把验收前移为选材：用准入清单与合同条款锁死健康低碳，而非竣工后补救。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"健康材料与室内环境质量","id":"健康材料与室内环境质量"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从「低排放」到「全成分透明」","id":"核心概念-从-低排放-到-全成分透明"},{"level":2,"text":"室内空气污染物：强制限值才是底线","id":"室内空气污染物-强制限值才是底线"},{"level":2,"text":"排放检测：CDPH 方法与 TVOC 分级","id":"排放检测-cdph-方法与-tvoc-分级"},{"level":2,"text":"成分透明：Red List、HPD 与 Declare 标签","id":"成分透明-red-list-hpd-与-declare-标签"},{"level":2,"text":"在中国落地：双认证与可执行清单","id":"在中国落地-双认证与可执行清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"循环建造与建筑适应性再利用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/sustainable-net-zero-architecture/materials-circularity/circular-construction-adaptive-reuse"},"next":{"title":"绿色建筑认证体系：LEED/BREEAM/三星/WELL","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/sustainable-net-zero-architecture/certification-policy-practice/green-building-rating-systems"}}